    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotdog Hustler</strong> is a gritty, retro-style food truck sim where you run a dodgy hotdog stand in the backstreets of a crime-ridden city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc5 <strong>Serve sketchy customers</strong> \u2013 Each customer has unique preferences and behavior. Some are aggressive, some hilarious, and some... deeply unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf56 <strong>Grill, stack, and sauce</strong> \u2013 Cook hotdogs to order, slap on condiments, and assemble meals fast before customers get angry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Manage your stand</strong> \u2013 Set prices, accept bribes, upsell extras, and avoid getting robbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfc <strong>PS2-era aesthetic</strong> \u2013 Janky animations, lo-fi visuals, and a VHS-tinted interface capture a nostalgic early 2000s vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc3 <strong>Day-by-day survival</strong> \u2013 You\u2019ll unlock new ingredients, encounter strange events, and try to keep your stand afloat while chaos unfolds around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on <strong>reaction-based gameplay</strong>, <strong>light strategy</strong>, and <strong>weird customer interactions</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotdog Hustler</strong> is a gritty, retro-style food truck sim where you run a dodgy hotdog stand in the backstreets of a crime-ridden city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc5 <strong>Serve sketchy customers</strong> \u2013 Each customer has unique preferences and behavior. Some are aggressive, some hilarious, and some... deeply unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf56 <strong>Grill, stack, and sauce</strong> \u2013 Cook hotdogs to order, slap on condiments, and assemble meals fast before customers get angry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Manage your stand</strong> \u2013 Set prices, accept bribes, upsell extras, and avoid getting robbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfc <strong>PS2-era aesthetic</strong> \u2013 Janky animations, lo-fi visuals, and a VHS-tinted interface capture a nostalgic early 2000s vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddc3 <strong>Day-by-day survival</strong> \u2013 You\u2019ll unlock new ingredients, encounter strange events, and try to keep your stand afloat while chaos unfolds around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on <strong>reaction-based gameplay</strong>, <strong>light strategy</strong>, and <strong>weird customer interactions</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83c\udf56 Fry meat, stack buns, and serve sketchy customers fast. \ud83d\udcb5 Set prices, upsell extras, or pocket shady bribes. \ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Handle weirdos who want ketchup\u2026 or chaos. \ud83d\udcfc A gritty, lo-fi PS2-style hotdog sim with janky charm.",
